# client must run it (matching hash) for consistent carts.
BetterCarts|1.1.1|BetterCarts.dll|b647395b0c1f893acabe1c9305b202b020ce11a828691fd23e9aa6e1db71d0d8|plugin+required|https://thunderstore.io/package/download/TastyChickenLegs/BetterCarts/1.1.1/
